Source package notes
====================

This is a separately packaged module of a larger upstream Git monorepo.
The Debian binary installs only the Linux Python CLI. It does NOT install
the Windows GUI, drivers, or privileged Windows service. The direct
upstream .deb builder is kept for historical comparison but Debian
maintainers should build the canonical source with dpkg-buildpackage.

The packaging branch currently names the author using GitHub's no-reply
address; REPLACE with an approved, monitored public maintainer email
before requesting sponsorship.

Because the upstream project has not tagged an isolated module release,
the source tarball is assembled by packaging/debian/build-source.sh from a
specified commit; reproducible release tags and a functional debian/watch
must be added before requesting a long-term sponsor.
